      en: ["The building acts as the local branch of the regional West African central bank.", "It is a rare example of modern high-rise architecture in the city center.", "The institution has managed the national currency since 1997.", "The building's design emphasizes transparency and institutional strength.", "It is located in the heart of the business and diplomatic district.", "The BCEAO tower is a central landmark for both locals and expatriates."]
